      en: ["El Guabo is recognized as a hub for global banana production.", "The canton was officially established on September 7, 1978.", "The city is located in the El Oro Province in southern Ecuador.", "Proximity to Puerto Bolívar is essential for agricultural exports.", "In addition to bananas, shrimp farming is a major industry.", "The city is situated just a few meters above sea level."],
